guide polestar-completionist-alliance/dungeon-blackrock-spire
title Blackrock Spire (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Dungeons
levels 57-60
zone Searing Gorge
next polestar-completionist-alliance/64-odd-jobs-in-the-eastern-kingdoms-4
pitch Blackrock Spire, in Searing Gorge.
why Every Alliance quest of Blackrock Spire: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

